# the master filter: GLO's Master filter page (between Master FX and Master out), its four knobs (the drums' filter
# and resonance, the mix's): left a low-pass, the centre off, right a high-pass; the screen reader's words; saved and
# loaded with the project; the MIDI CCs on the master's channel 11 (30, 31 the drums', 74, 71 the mix's)
wait 300
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...x...
expect mst.dfilt 64
expect mst.dres 0
expect mst.mfilt 64
expect mst.mres 0
listen
tap GLO
expect page Mix
turn SELECT 3
wait 400
expect page Master_filter
said Master filter
wait 40
shot master_filter_off.png
# KNOB 1: the drums' filter a quarter left, a low-pass (48: 5.8 kHz)
spin K1 -16
expect mst.dfilt 48
wait 400
said drums LP 5.8 kHz
spin K2 90
expect mst.dres 90
# KNOB 3: the mix's a quarter right, a high-pass (80: 73 Hz)
spin K3 16
expect mst.mfilt 80
wait 400
said mix HP 73 Hz
spin K4 40
expect mst.mres 40
# the dead zone: 62 .. 66 off
spin K3 -15
expect mst.mfilt 65
wait 400
said mix off
spin K3 15
expect mst.mfilt 80
tap PLAY
wait 600
shot master_filter.png
tap PLAY
# saved, and back after a reboot
projsave 1 filt
reboot
wait 400
expect mst.dfilt 48
expect mst.dres 90
expect mst.mfilt 80
expect mst.mres 40
# the CCs on channel 11: 30 the drums' filter, 31 its resonance, 74 the mix's, 71 its resonance (0..127 as they come)
midi BA 1E 7F
midi BA 1F 00
midi BA 4A 00
midi BA 47 7F
wait 40
expect mst.dfilt 127
expect mst.dres 0
expect mst.mfilt 0
expect mst.mres 127
# the help card: GLO held on the page
tap GLO
turn SELECT 3
expect page Master_filter
listen
press GLO
wait 1000
shot master_filter_card.png
said Master filter
release GLO
expect page Master_filter
